      "value": "This twisted and grim-looking staff is adorned with hideous skull and bone motifs. While wielding the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to identify necromancy magic. You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip chill touch 1st grim tendrils, ray of enfeeblement 2nd deafness, gentle repose"
